      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA CUKAI PENDAPATAN 1967 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Walau apa pun seksyen 43 Akta ibu, apa-apa amaun yang ditentukan di bawah perenggan 43(3)(b) Akta ibu bagi tahun taksiran 2018 bolehlah diambil kira bagi maksud potongan di bawah subseksyen 43(2) Akta ibu bagi tahun taksiran 2019 dan tahun-tahun taksiran yang berikutnya hingga tahun taksiran 2025 dan apa-apa amaun yang tidak dapat dipotong menurut subseksyen 43(2) Akta ibu selepas berakhirnya tahun taksiran 2025 tidak boleh diambil kira bagi maksud Akta ibu. Pindaan seksyen 44"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 44 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (5e) subseksyen yang berikut: “(5F) Notwithstanding subsection (4) or (5), the amount ascertained under either of those subsections for any relevant year shall only be deductible in accordance with subsection 43(2) for a period of seven consecutive years of assessment and that period commences immediately following the relevant year of assessment and any amount or balance of the amount which is not deductible at the end of that period shall be disregarded for the purposes of this Act.”. Pindaan seksyen 44a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 44A Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “may” perkataan “, for the basis period for three consecutive years of assessment,”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1A) For the purpose of subsection (1), the basis period for three consecutive years of assessment commences— (a) immediately following the basis period for a year of assessment the surrendering company first commences operation, provided that the basis period consists of a period of twelve months; or (b) immediately following the second basis period the surrendering company first commences operation (in this paragraph referred to as the “second basis period”), if the basis period for a year of assessment the surrendering company first commences operation is less or more than twelve months and the second basis period consists of a period of twelve months.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (10), dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (a) perenggan yang berikut: “(aa) has unutilized investment tax allowance or adjusted loss from a pioneer business under the Promotion of Investments Act 1986;”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_d__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_d__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (12)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_d__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_d",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam takrif “ordinary shares”, dengan memotong perkataan “nominal”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_d__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_d",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam takrif “residual profits”, dengan memotong perkataan “nominal”. Peruntukan khas yang berhubungan dengan seksyen 44a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Walau apa pun subseksyen 44A(1) Akta ibu sebagaimana yang dipinda dalam Akta ini, suatu syarikat penyerah boleh menyerahkan kerugian larasannya bagi tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran mengikut subseksyen itu bagi tempoh asas—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "tahun taksiran 2019, berhubung dengan suatu syarikat penyerah yang pertama kali memulakan operasinya dalam tahun taksiran 2015;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "tahun taksiran 2019 dan 2020, berhubung dengan suatu syarikat penyerah yang pertama kali memulakan operasinya dalam tahun taksiran 2016; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "tahun taksiran 2019, 2020 dan 2021, berhubung dengan suatu syarikat penyerah yang pertama kali memulakan operasinya dalam tahun taksiran 2017. Pindaan seksyen 46"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 46(1)(k) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “six” di mana-mana jua terdapat dengan perkataan “eight”. Pindaan seksyen 49"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 49 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) Subject to this section, in the case of an individual resident for the basis year for a year of assessment, there shall be allowed for that year of assessment a deduction— (a) not exceeding three thousand ringgit, in respect of premium paid by that individual for any insurance; (b) not exceeding four thousand ringgit, in respect of contribution to approved scheme (other than a private retirement scheme) made or suffered by that individual who is an employee or a self-employed person within the meaning of the Employees Provident Fund Act 1991 [Act 452]; or (c) not exceeding four thousand ringgit, in respect of any amount made or suffered by that individual on any contribution under any written law relating to widow, widower and orphan’s pension or under any approved scheme within the meaning of any such law.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1A) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1a) For the purpose of subsection (1)— (a) the total amount of deduction under subsection (1) shall not exceed seven thousand ringgit; (b) where subsection 50(2) or 50(3) applies, the amount of deduction to be allowed shall be in accordance with paragraphs (1)(a), (b) and (c) and the total deduction under subsection 50(2) or (3) shall not exceed seven thousand ringgit; (c) in the case of an individual who is a pensionable officer within the meaning of section 2 of the Pensions Act 1980 [Act 227] and no deduction is made under paragraph (1)(b) or (c) to that individual, the amount of deduction under paragraph (1)(a) shall not exceed seven thousand ringgit.”. Pindaan seksyen 60"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_g"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 60 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perenggan (b) dengan perenggan yang berikut: “(b) where an insurer carries on re-insurance business, the re-insurance business and the general business (excluding the re-insurance business) shall be treated as separate businesses;”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (c), dengan menggantikan proviso dengan proviso yang berikut: “Provided that where the insurer also carries on life re-insurance business, the life re-insurance business shall be a separate source from life business and shall be treated as a general business;”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
