        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perenggan 3 dengan perenggan yang berikut: “3. Income tax shall be charged for a year of assessment on the chargeable income of an insurer from a re-insurance business at the rate of 8 per cent on every ringgit of the chargeable income.”; dan"
