        "@value": "dalam perenggan 75, dengan memotong perkataan “until the whole amount of the allowance or that aggregate amount to be made to him has been made to him”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_24__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
