        "@value": "dengan menggantikan takrif “Labuan company” dengan takrif yang berikut: ‘ “Labuan company” means a Labuan entity as provided under subsection 2b(1) of the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990;’; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_b",
