      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_58__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (6)(c), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “(6)” perkataan “, (6A)”. Pindaan seksyen 29n"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_59",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "59",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 29N(4) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “(5)” perkataan “, (5A)”. Pindaan seksyen 29o"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_60",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "60",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_60__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_60__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 29o Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_60__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_60",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (6), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “(6)” perkataan “, (6A)”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_60__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_60",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (7), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “(5)” perkataan “, (5A)”. Peruntukan khas yang berhubungan dengan seksyen 29j, 29k, 29L, 29N DAN 29O"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_61",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "61",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_61__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_61__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Walau apa pun subseksyen 29j(4), 29k(4), 29L(2), (3),"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "(4), (5) dan (6), 29N(4) dan 29o(6) dan (7) Akta ibu dan subseksyen 29j(4), 29k(4), 29L(2), (3), (4), (5) dan (6), 29N(4) dan 29o(6) dan (7) sebagaimana yang dipinda masing-masing oleh seksyen 56, 57, 58, 59 dan 60 Akta ini, mana-mana amaun elaun yang tidak boleh diberikan di bawah subseksyen 29j(4), 29k(4), 29L(2), (3), (4), (5) dan (6), 29N(4) dan 29o(6) dan (7) sebelum permulaan kuat kuasa seksyen 56, 57, 58, 59 dan 60 Akta ini bagi tahun taksiran yang berkaitan dengan tempoh asas apabila tempoh lima tahun atau sepuluh tahun, mana-mana yang berkenaan, yang dinyatakan dalam perenggan 29j(3)(b), 29k(3)(b), subperenggan 29L(2)(a)(ii), 29N(3)(b) atau 29o(3)(b) berakhir—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_61__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_61",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "hendaklah hanya diberikan kepada syarikat itu mengikut subseksyen 29j(4), 29k(4), 29L(2), (3), (4), (5) dan (6), 29N(4) dan 29o(6) dan (7) Akta ibu, seolah-olah Akta ibu tidak dipinda, bagi tempoh tujuh tahun taksiran berturut-turut dan tempoh itu bermula sebaik selepas tahun taksiran 2018; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_61__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_61",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "apa-apa amaun elaun pada akhir tempoh itu yang masih belum diberikan kepada syarikat itu, oleh sebab ketidakcukupan atau ketiadaan pendapatan berkanun daripada perniagaannya bagi tempoh itu, tidak boleh diambil kira bagi maksud Akta ibu. Pindaan seksyen 30a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III__para_62",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "62",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 30A(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “dua” dengan perkataan “lima”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "IV",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_63",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_64",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_65",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_67",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_68"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA SETEM 1949 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Setem 1949"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_63",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "63",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_63__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_63__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_63__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_63",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 64, 65, 66, 67 dan perenggan 68(a), (b), (c) dan (e) mula berkuat kuasa apabila berkuatkuasanya Akta ini."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_63__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_63",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 68(d) mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2019. Pindaan seksyen 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_64",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "64",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_64__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_64__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Setem 1949, yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Bab ini, dipinda dalam seksyen 2—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_64__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan takrif “banker” dengan takrif yang berikut: ‘ “banker” means— (a) any person licensed under the Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 758] to carry on a banking business in Malaysia; (b) any person licensed under the Islamic Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 759] to carry on an Islamic banking business in Malaysia; or (c) a development financial institution prescribed under Development Financial Institutions Act 2002 [Act 618];’; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_64__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan takrif “small and medium enterprise” dengan takrif yang berikut: ‘ “small and medium enterprise” means— (a) in relation to the manufacturing activities, an enterprise with sales turnover not exceeding fifty million ringgit or full-time employees not exceeding two hundred people; or (b) in relation to the services, and other sectors, an enterprise with sales turnover not exceeding twenty million ringgit or full-time employees not exceeding seventy-five people;’. Pindaan seksyen 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_65",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "65",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_65__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_65__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 9 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_65__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_65",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) The Collector, may by notification in the Gazette, authorize any person including any banker, dealer or insurer, to compound for the payment of duty on unstamped instrument subject to the condition that the instrument be drawn or drawn up and issued on a form to be supplied or adopted by the said person.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_65__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_65",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (6), dengan menggantikan perkataan “as mentioned under paragraph 1(a), (b) or (c)” dengan perkataan “under subsection (1)”. Pindaan seksyen 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
