      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 15 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “nominal share capital” di mana-mana jua terdapat dengan perkataan “issued share capital”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong subseksyen (2);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_c__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (b), dengan menggantikan perkataan “two years” dengan perkataan “three years”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (c), dengan menggantikan perkataan “two years” dengan perkataan “three years”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_66",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (6) subseksyen yang berikut: “(6A) Where any claim for exemption from duty under this section has been allowed and any of the circumstances specified under subsection (5) occurs, each company which was a party to the instrument shall notify the Collector of the circumstances of the occurrence within thirty days from the date of the occurrence.”. Pindaan seksyen 15a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_67",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "67",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_67__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_67__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_67__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 15A Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_67__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_67",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(2) This section applies to any instrument with respect to which it is shown to the satisfaction of the Collector— (a) that the effect is to transfer a beneficial interest in property from one company with limited liability to another such company, and that the companies are associated where one is the beneficial owner of not less than ninety per cent of the issued share capital of the other, or that a third company with limited liability is the beneficial owner of not less than ninety per centum of the issued share capital of each of the aforesaid companies; (b) that the transfer of the property of the associated companies is to achieve greater efficiency in operation; and (c) that the company referred to as the transferee company under this section is incorporated in Malaysia.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/msa@/~sched_3__chp_IV__para_67__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
